<mxCell id="a18" value="The analyst asked “which,” not for an order — so the multiset compare is the product metric. Spider&#x27;s original component match fails the missing ORDER BY; BIRD&#x27;s result-set scorer accepts it. Authorization sits beside correctness." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="354" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
